      "widgets_values": [
        "XYZ-Stitch Example Workflow\n----------------------------\n\nRequired:\n- ComfyUI-XYZ-stitch\n- ComfyUI Impact Pack\n- Any SDXL checkpoint\n\nWhat this does:\n- Generates an XYZ parameter grid\n- Collects all outputs\n- Stitches them into one grid image\n- Saves only after all combinations are complete\n\nHow to use:\n1. Load your SDXL model.\n2. Edit X/Y/Z values in XYZGridInputBatch.\n3. Queue Prompt (batch : 1).\n\nNote:\nSaveImage runs only when \"is_complete\" becomes TRUE, saved Grid Image."
      ],
